{"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"inheritsFrom","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/InputEvent"],"kind":"relationships","title":"Inherits From"},{"type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/SQ","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/SH","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/s12IdentifiableP","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/17SwiftGodotRuntime18VariantConvertibleP"],"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"InputEventMIDI","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"InputEventMIDI stores information about messages from "},{"type":"text","text":"MIDI"},{"type":"text","text":" (Musical Instrument Digital Interface) devices. These may include musical keyboards, synthesizers, and drum machines."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"MIDI messages can be received over a 5-pin MIDI connector or over USB. If your device supports both be sure to check the settings in the device to see which output it is using."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"By default, Godot does not detect MIDI devices. You need to call "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/OS\/openMidiInputs()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", first. You can check which devices are detected with "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/OS\/getConnectedMidiInputs()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", and close the connection with "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/OS\/closeMidiInputs()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Godot does not support MIDI output, so there is no way to emit MIDI messages from Godot. Only MIDI input is supported."}]}],"style":"note","type":"aside"},{"name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On the Web platform, using MIDI input requires a browser permission to be granted first. This permission request is performed when calling "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/OS\/openMidiInputs()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". MIDI input will not work until the user accepts the permission request."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note","type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftgodot\/inputeventmidi"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Represents a MIDI message from a MIDI device, such as a musical keyboard."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/InputEventMIDI"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/InputEventMIDI\/channel","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/InputEventMIDI\/controllerNumber","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/InputEventMIDI\/controllerValue","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/InputEventMIDI\/instrument","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/InputEventMIDI\/message","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/InputEventMIDI\/pitch","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/InputEventMIDI\/pressure","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/InputEventMIDI\/velocity"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/InputEventMIDI\/godotClassName"],"ge